  "strategy": "UR High Tide storm combo",
  "colors": "UR",
  "identity": "UR High Tide storm combo. The engine — High Tide (doubles Island mana) plus a suite of free/cheap untappers (Snap, Cloud of Faeries, Frantic Search, Turnabout) and cost reduction from Helm of Awakening — generates a large mana surplus and storm count in a single turn, which Grapeshot converts into lethal damage. Empty the Warrens (x2) is the redundant board-based kill and Storm Entity a proactive backup clock; Stroke of Genius refuels the chain or decks the opponent out on a big-mana turn. Force of Will, Counterspell and Circular Logic protect the combo turn, while Mystical Tutor and Overmaster add consistency and push the kill past a counter.",
